```shell
$ curl -H "X-AIO-Key: {io_key}" https://io.adafruit.com/api/v2/{username}/tokens/{id}
```

```python
```

```cpp
```

```ruby
```

> Response Sample:

```json
{
  "id": 123,
  "key": "aio_xxxx00xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
  "name": null,
  "status": "active",
  "master": true,
  "readable": true,
  "createable": true,
  "updateable": true,
  "deleteable": true,
  "expiration": null,
  "feed_id": null,
  "qr_code": "data:image/png;base64,...",
